# The launcher stages Git-indexed/unignored public files across the repository.
# Preserve root docs/config and future source trees while excluding credentials.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.ruff_cache
**/.codex
**/.agents
!.agents
.agents/**
!.agents/plugins
.agents/plugins/**
!.agents/plugins/marketplace.json
**/.claude
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.env*
**/auth.json
**/credentials
**/credentials.json
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
